 :statement "$T X T^\\dagger = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(X + Y)$: Computing $T X T^\\dagger = \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & \\omega \\end{pmatrix} \\begin{pmatrix} 0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\end{pmatrix} \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & \\omega^* \\end{pmatrix} = \\begin{pmatrix} 0 & \\omega^* \\\\ \\omega & 0 \\end{pmatrix}$. Since $\\omega = e^{i\\pi/4} = \\frac{1+i}{\\sqrt{2}}$ and $\\omega^* = \\frac{1-i}{\\sqrt{2}}$, we have $\\begin{pmatrix} 0 & \\omega^* \\\\ \\omega & 0 \\end{pmatrix} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\begin{pmatrix} 0 & 1-i \\\\ 1+i & 0 \\end{pmatrix} = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\left( \\begin{pmatrix} 0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\end{pmatrix} + \\begin{pmatrix} 0 & -i \\\\ i & 0 \\end{pmatrix} \\right) = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}(X + Y)$."
